  "change_kinds": [
    {
      "id": "forms-fields",
      "name": "Record types, fields and form layouts",
      "who": "system managers",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 1,
      "evidence": "Custom DocTypes, Custom Fields and Customize Form changes are made in Desk with no deploy (frappe/core/doctype/doctype/doctype.py:329-340, 539-546; frappe/custom/doctype/customize_form). Undo: DocType, Custom Field and Property Setter track changes, so every change keeps a Version with the earlier values (their .json: track_changes 1); Customize Form resets a form's layout or all its customisations (customize_form.py:635-660, 692-712); deleted documents can be restored for 180 days (frappe/core/doctype/deleted_document/deleted_document.py:32-70). No one-step revert to an earlier version (GOV-05 is 2), so undo is by hand from the recorded history.",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "reach_name": "Self-serve"
    },
    {
      "id": "workflows-automation",
      "name": "Approval workflows, notifications and automation rules",
      "who": "system managers and process owners",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 1,
      "evidence": "Workflow, Notification and Automation Flow are DocTypes edited in Desk with no deploy (frappe/workflow/doctype/workflow, frappe/email/doctype/notification, frappe/automation/doctype/automation_flow); each tracks changes and can be switched off (workflow.json is_active, notification.json and automation_flow.json enabled). No one-step revert to an earlier version (GOV-05 is 2), so undo is by hand from the recorded history.",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "reach_name": "Self-serve"
    },
    {
      "id": "permissions",
      "name": "Who can see and change what (roles and permissions)",
      "who": "system managers",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 1,
      "evidence": "Role Permission Manager changes Custom DocPerm rules with no deploy; each change is written to Permission Log and a DocType's permissions can be reset to standard (frappe/core/page/permission_manager/permission_manager.py:179-247); User Permission and Role track changes.",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "reach_name": "Self-serve"
    },
    {
      "id": "reports-print",
      "name": "Reports and printed documents",
      "who": "system managers and report users",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 1,
      "evidence": "Report Builder reports are saved in Desk and Report tracks changes (frappe/core/doctype/report/report.json); the print format builder keeps drafts and named versions that can be loaded back and applied (frappe/printing/doctype/print_format/print_format.py:461-560). Script reports need Server Scripts or app code.",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "reach_name": "Self-serve"
    },
    {
      "id": "server-logic-apps",
      "name": "Custom server-side logic, integrations and new apps",
      "who": "system managers, with engineers",
      "main": false,
      "reach": 0,
      "evidence": "Server Scripts can be enabled only by editing common_site_config.json (frappe/utils/safe_exec.py:86-88), and new apps and bespoke integrations are installed with bench commands (frappe/commands/site.py:559); both need an engineer. Not main: most change requests are met by the self-serve kinds above and by Client Scripts, Automation Flows and Notifications; a rater who reads server-side logic as a large share would mark this main and the people path would drop to 1.",
      "confidence": "low",
      "reach_name": "Engineers only"
    }
  ],
